<darktable_style version="1.0">
 <info>
  <name>Canon EOS RP Lightroom match (agx + LUT)</name>
  <description>Matches Lightroom 'Camera Standard' for the EOS RP: neutral agx base (primaries adjustments off) + exposure ~+1.0 EV (adjust per image to taste) + fitted 3D LUT. LUT fitted with per-image exposure alignment; needs 'EOS RP Lightroom match.cube' in the lut3d root. Spektrafilm 5.8 build.</description>
 </info>
